OL,3,CPrisoners confined to cells for longer
OL,4,Cas officers begin protest
OL,6,FGuernsey prisoners will spend longer
OL,7,Fin their cells and have visiting times
OL,8,Fmoved as officers begin a 'work to
OL,9,Frule' protest.
OL,11,FStaff at Les Nicolles are only working
OL,12,Ftheir contracted hours from Monday 27
OL,13,FJuly for one week, with the
OL,14,Fauthorities saying there will be a
OL,15,Fknock-on effect on how the facility
OL,16,Foperates.
OL,18,FIt means some of the usual activities
OL,19,Fthe 91 prisoners take part in have
OL,20,Fbeen dropped or rescheduled.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,354,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F353A1785235678
OL,3,CPrisoners confined to cells for longer
OL,4,Cas officers begin protest
OL,6,FThe prison insists it has plans in
OL,7,Fplace "to ensure the continued safe
OL,8,Fdelivery" of its services.
OL,10,FHowever, in a statement, Dave Le Ray,
OL,11,FDirector of Operations for Justice and
OL,12,FRegulation in Guernsey, adds: "Some
OL,13,Fchanges are required to the weekday
OL,14,Fregime as a result, which will align
OL,15,Fto that ordinarily in place at
OL,16,Fweekends.
OL,18,F"Some activities for prisoners have
OL,19,Fbeen moved or cancelled and visitation
OL,20,Fhas been moved to the afternoon at 3pm.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,354,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F353A1785235678
OL,3,CPrisoners confined to cells for longer
OL,4,Cas officers begin protest
OL,6,F"Prisoners will also be confined to
OL,7,Ftheir cells at an earlier time on
OL,8,Fweekdays this week, equivalent to that
OL,9,Fwhich is standard practice for
OL,10,Fweekends.
OL,12,F"These are unavoidable but necessary
OL,13,Ftemporary changes for the next week."
OL,15,FMr Le Ray explains that discussions
OL,16,Fwith the prison officers' union,
OL,17,FUnite, and its members will continue
OL,18,Fthis week to "address concerns where
OL,19,Fpossible".
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/4
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
