OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,354,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F353A1785235678
OL,3,CPrisoners confined to cells for longer
OL,4,Cas officers begin protest
OL,6,FITV Channel has approached Unite The
OL,7,FUnion for comment and to share the
OL,8,Freasons for the 'work to rule' protest.
OL,10,FThis news follows a turbulent period
OL,11,Ffor the prison which has seen Governor
OL,12,FJohn de Carteret step aside pending an
OL,13,Finvestigation into his conduct and the
OL,14,Fannouncement of an independent review
OL,15,Fafter two inmates died in their cells.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/4
